                            <comment id="14638465" author="sergi.vladykin" created="Thu, 23 Jul 2015 08:24:18 +0000"  >&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Refactored the current SQL splitter so that it always updates initial SQL AST without any cloning.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Fixed schema search to look into SELECT and WHERE clauses but not only into FROM clause.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Implemented hierarchical search and split of aggregate functions inside of any complex expression in SELECT clause.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
